RTX Housing System 45.0 - the biggest update ever

What to replace:

Replace ALL files of rtx_housing, including config.lua, the html folder and the configs folder (8 new config files, new pet furniture in configs/furniture.lua). Then copy your own settings back into the new files. Replace rtx_housing_coreprops too, it contains the new pet models (stream/[pets]). Start it before rtx_housing. Add the new hotel_keycard item (uses metadata) to your inventory. Optional: evidence_bag and pet food items. You can find all items in the Items folder. New database tables are created automatically, no SQL import needed. Check the positions of the pet shops, post offices and LS Stays booking points on your map. What's new:

Pets: dogs, cats, rabbits, hamsters, guinea pigs, rats and fish with custom cages, needs and care, smart behaviour, guard dogs, rat on your shoulder Hotels and Motels: shell/IPL hotels or real MLO motel rooms with real doors, key cards, room menu with room service, minibar and housekeeping, room upgrades, reviews Hotel Business: players buy and run hotels with staff, promotions and upgrades LS Stays: booking app with filters, booking from anywhere and GPS to your room Short Stays: players rent out their own home Live Property Auctions: repossessed properties are auctioned at the house with an auctioneer Search Warrants and Break-in Evidence: fingerprints, footprints, fibers, tool marks Camera Recordings: who came in and out, with portraits Home Insurance: plans and automatic claims after break-ins Mail and Post Office: letters and packages to any address Home Spawn: wake up in your own bed Furniture Catalog: add furniture in game, smart import of any prop pack, photo studio Migration: easy migration from any housing system New property market filters, key blips, new exports, events and commands All new texts in 18 languages Documentation: https://rtx-dev.gitbook.io/rtxdev/rtx-housing-system Video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=yuxJwlB0HAk
